{%- comment -%}
  Local Inventory Ads feed (Google Merchant Center "local product inventory").

  Replaces the manual upload fs_showroom_local_inventory.tsv with a stable
  Shopify URL that Merchant Center can fetch on a schedule, per Tim's Sept 5
  direction. Availability and quantity re-derive from live Shopify on every
  fetch; offer membership comes from the generated allowlist (see below).

  Bound to an alternate collection template, so the cohort is the collection in
  the URL:

    /collections/french-fitness-showroom-products?view=local-inventory-tsv

  Four columns, tab-delimited, header row first:
    id, store_code, availability, quantity

  ID RULE (Tim's decision 2, supersedes item 4.2). Verified against the live
  googleshoppingfs and googleshoppingfrenchfitness exports: MultiFeeds uses
  three schemes, and a mismatched id processes as "Offer does not exist".
    1. Multi-variant product -> "<product.id>-<variant.id>"      (45 rows today)
    2. Single-variant carrying custom.old_legacy_product_code ->
       that legacy code (FFT-CFDI is keyed FFA-CFDI)             (1 row today)
    3. Otherwise -> variant.sku                                  (220 rows today)

  ELIGIBILITY (Tim's decision 3). custom.processing_time_filter is PRIMARY:
  "Ships in 2 weeks or less" is eligible; "2-5 weeks", "5 weeks or more" and
  "Out of Stock" are not. When the filter is missing, fall back to the
  three-metafield cascade, most-specific-first, parsing the MAXIMUM stated lead
  time at 10 business days or less. Missing both = not eligible.

  AVAILABILITY (Tim's decision 4). Eligible rows publish on_display_to_order,
  never in_stock - these are showroom display units that ship to the customer.
  Not eligible publishes out_of_stock.

  QUANTITY (Tim's decision 5). 1 eligible / 0 not. Shopify's stored numbers are
  orderability placeholders (9,989 / 449,511 / negatives), never shelf counts,
  and must never publish.

  MEMBERSHIP (Tim's decision 6). A row is emitted only for an offer ID present
  in snippets/local-inventory-offer-allowlist.liquid. 154 variants in the
  showroom collection have no primary offer and are excluded.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign TAB = '	' -%}
{%- assign NL = '
' -%}

{%- comment -%} Merchant Center store code. Do not change without Tim's GO. {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign STORE_CODE = 'FSS1' -%}

{%- comment -%} Two weeks, in business days, for the fallback gate only. {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign MAX_LEAD_BUSINESS_DAYS = 10 -%}

{%- assign ELIGIBLE_FILTER = 'ships in 2 weeks or less' -%}

{%- comment -%}
  Offer IDs the primary Google feeds carry. render has an isolated scope, so the
  snippet outputs the list and we capture it here.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture PRIMARY_OFFER_IDS -%}{%- render 'local-inventory-offer-allowlist' -%}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign PRIMARY_OFFER_IDS = PRIMARY_OFFER_IDS | strip -%}

{%- capture feed -%}
id{{ TAB }}store_code{{ TAB }}availability{{ TAB }}quantity
{%- assign seen_offers = '|' -%}
{%- paginate collection.products by 1000 -%}
  {%- for product in collection.products -%}
    {%- for variant in product.variants -%}

      {%- assign sku = variant.sku | strip -%}
      {%- if sku == blank -%}
        {%- continue -%}
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- comment -%} Offer ID, per the three-part ID RULE above. {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- if product.variants.size > 1 -%}
        {%- assign offer_id = product.id | append: '-' | append: variant.id -%}
      {%- else -%}
        {%- assign legacy_code = variant.metafields.custom.old_legacy_product_code.value | first | strip -%}
        {%- if legacy_code != blank -%}
          {%- assign offer_id = legacy_code -%}
        {%- else -%}
          {%- assign offer_id = sku -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- comment -%} Skip anything the primary feed does not carry. {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- assign offer_key = '|' | append: offer_id | append: '|' -%}
      {%- unless PRIMARY_OFFER_IDS contains offer_key -%}
        {%- continue -%}
      {%- endunless -%}

      {%- if seen_offers contains offer_key -%}
        {%- continue -%}
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- assign seen_offers = seen_offers | append: offer_id | append: '|' -%}

      {%- comment -%} Eligibility: structured filter first, cascade only if absent. {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- assign pt_filter = product.metafields.custom.processing_time_filter | downcase | strip -%}
      {%- assign eligible = false -%}

      {%- if pt_filter != blank -%}
        {%- if pt_filter == ELIGIBLE_FILTER -%}
          {%- assign eligible = true -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- else -%}
        {%- assign lead_raw = variant.metafields.custom.processing_time_long_variant -%}
        {%- if lead_raw == blank -%}
          {%- assign lead_raw = product.metafields.custom.processing_time_long -%}
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if lead_raw == blank -%}
          {%- assign lead_raw = product.metafields.custom.processing_time -%}
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- assign lead = lead_raw | downcase | strip -%}

        {%- comment -%}
          Parse the MAXIMUM stated lead time. "3-7 Business Days" yields 7, not
          3. Weeks convert at 5 business days. Blank or unparseable stays -1,
          which never qualifies.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- assign lead_days = -1 -%}
        {%- if lead contains 'business day' -%}
          {%- assign lead_token = lead | split: 'business day' | first | strip | split: ' ' | last | split: '-' | last | strip -%}
          {%- assign lead_number = lead_token | times: 1 -%}
          {%- if lead_number > 0 -%}
            {%- assign lead_days = lead_number -%}
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- elsif lead contains 'week' -%}
          {%- assign lead_token = lead | split: 'week' | first | strip | split: ' ' | last | split: '-' | last | strip -%}
          {%- assign lead_number = lead_token | times: 1 -%}
          {%- if lead_number > 0 -%}
            {%- assign lead_days = lead_number | times: 5 -%}
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if lead_days > 0 and lead_days <= MAX_LEAD_BUSINESS_DAYS -%}
          {%- assign eligible = true -%}
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if lead contains 'restock' -%}
          {%- assign eligible = false -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if eligible -%}
        {%- assign availability = 'on_display_to_order' -%}
        {%- assign quantity = 1 -%}
      {%- else -%}
        {%- assign availability = 'out_of_stock' -%}
        {%- assign quantity = 0 -%}
      {%- endif -%}

      {{- NL -}}{{- offer_id -}}{{- TAB -}}{{- STORE_CODE -}}{{- TAB -}}{{- availability -}}{{- TAB -}}{{- quantity -}}

    {%- endfor -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
{%- endpaginate -%}
{%- endcapture -%}
{{- feed | strip -}}
{{- NL -}}
